{"3351260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "H.A.I.N", "steam_appid": 3351260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Ritual. A Betrayal. A Hunt in the Dark.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H.A.I.N: Heir of the Ancient Immortal Necromancer is a 1–4 player co-op ritual horror game set across cursed forests, abandoned towns, forgotten cemeteries, and the haunted depths of an ancient mine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: recover the four artifacts and complete the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is not simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ritual begins, one of you is chosen as the Necromancer’s Heir.<br>Their identity is secret. Their purpose is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Survivors must work together, stay hidden, and use artifact powers to withstand the darkness.<br><br>H.A.I.N must deceive, stalk, and sabotage waiting for the perfect moment to strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/2ace01690136cc70da3eb5e70d0f9a14.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras_big/2ace01690136cc70da3eb5e70d0f9a14.webp?t=1788196719 width=1560 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The danger never stops.</strong><br> <br> Brought here as a sacrifice for the Necromancer, you are nothing more than a toy in her eyes. Before claiming your soul, she chooses to play with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.poster.avif?t=1788196719\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.webm?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.mp4?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/2a4ffaeabb1f9fce3881c92a2359b476.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras_big/2a4ffaeabb1f9fce3881c92a2359b476.webp?t=1788196719 width=1560 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the regions of <strong>Wraithmere,</strong> from abandoned village to cursed mine, each area reveals a different face of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rendered with <strong>ultra-realistic visuals</strong>, dynamic lighting, and heavy atmosphere, Wraithmere feels alive every shadow, every fog layer reacts to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/831fdb4055439167b4fe0cd9d4547067.poster.avif?t=1788196719\" aria-label=\"HAIN\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/831fdb4055439167b4fe0cd9d4547067.webm?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/831fdb4055439167b4fe0cd9d4547067.mp4?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/18bbd6accde64cf5b9b44df7dedaae80.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras_big/18bbd6accde64cf5b9b44df7dedaae80.webp?t=1788196719 width=1560 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal the secrets of the map.</strong><br><br><br> Wraithmere is filled with dark secrets. Explore hidden locations, follow the clues, and uncover the truth behind the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/403334cb42c92cbde3bb33e3229b3f2a.poster.avif?t=1788196719\" aria-label=\"HAIN\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/403334cb42c92cbde3bb33e3229b3f2a.webm?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/403334cb42c92cbde3bb33e3229b3f2a.mp4?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/f3fddbf2c6c2f8de9bb344fb2571130f.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras_big/f3fddbf2c6c2f8de9bb344fb2571130f.webp?t=1788196719 width=1560 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own character.</strong><br><br><br> Customize your appearance freely and roam the cursed lands of Wraithmere with a character that is truly yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/201de5f1c81e5c2e31411a55dc5f808e.poster.avif?t=1788196719\" aria-label=\"HAIN\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_