mplete the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is not simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ritual begins, one of you is chosen as the Necromancer’s Heir.<br>Their identity is secret. Their purpose is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Survivors must work together, stay hidden, and use artifact powers to withstand the darkness.<br><br>H.A.I.N must deceive, stalk, and sabotage waiting for the perfect moment to strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/2ace01690136cc70da3eb5e70d0f9a14.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras_big/2ace01690136cc70da3eb5e70d0f9a14.webp?t=1788196719 width=1560 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The danger never stops.</strong><br> <br> Brought here as a sacrifice for the Necromancer, you are nothing more than a toy in her eyes. Before claiming your soul, she chooses to play with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.poster.avif?t=1788196719\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.webm?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/dbe44d0cdd3a0fea80ef9957c8cf9767.mp4?t=1788196719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351260/extras/2a4ffaeabb1f9fce3881c92a2359b476.avif?t=1788196719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.ste